    "exercises": [
      {
        "number": "88",
        "source_number": "88",
        "group": null,
        "text": "88. 确定下列方程的次数：\na) $x^2+y^2-12=0$；\nb) $5x-6y-14=0$；\nc) $x^3-5x^2y^4+y^5-8y^3=0$；\nd) $x^2-5x^3y+y^4-1=0$；\ne) $x-xy=65$；\nf) $x^4-8x^2y^3+y^4=16$；\ng) $3xy=x(y+1)-5y$；\nh) $7x^8-12xy+y=7x^2(x^6+1)$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "89",
        "source_number": "89",
        "group": null,
        "text": "89. 下列变量取值数对是方程$x^2-y+2=0$的解吗？\na) $x=1$，$y=3$；\nb) $x=0$，$y=0$；\nc) $x=-2$，$y=2$；\nd) $x=-1$，$y=-3$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "90",
        "source_number": "90",
        "group": null,
        "text": "90. 求下列方程的任意两个解：\na) $x-3y=1$；\nb) $5x+y=2$；\nc) $x-xy=15$；\nd) $x^2+3y=1$；\ne) $(x-1)(y-2)=0$；\nf) $(x^2+1)(y-5)=0$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "91",
        "source_number": "91",
        "group": null,
        "text": "91.\na) 证明：方程$(x+5)^2+(y-2)^2=-1$没有解。\nb) 证明：方程$(x-7)^2+(y+4)^2=0$有唯一解。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "92",
        "source_number": "92",
        "group": null,
        "text": "92. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $2x-3y=6$；\nb) $\\frac{x}{2}+\\frac{y}{3}=1$；\nc) $x=-4$；\nd) $y=2$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "93",
        "source_number": "93",
        "group": null,
        "text": "93. 说明下列方程的图象是什么，并作出图象：\na) $(x-y)(x+y)=0$；\nb) $(x-3)(y+1)=0$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "94",
        "source_number": "94",
        "group": null,
        "text": "94. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $y=\\frac{6}{x}$；\nb) $xy=-12$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "95",
        "source_number": "95",
        "group": null,
        "text": "95. 作出下列方程的图象：\na) $x^2+y^2=16$；\nb) $x^2+y^2=36$；\nc) $x^2+y^2=6\\frac{1}{4}$；\nd) $x^2+y^2=20$；\ne) $x^2+y^2=12$；\nf) $x^2+y^2=0$.",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "96",
        "source_number": "96",
        "group": null,
        "text": "96. 写出圆心在坐标原点、半径等于下列各数的圆周的方程：\na) 2；\nb) 4.5；\nc) $\\sqrt{13}$；\nd) $\\frac{\\sqrt{6}}{2}$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "97",
        "source_number": "97",
        "group": null,
        "text": "97. 下列各点在圆周$x^2+y^2=144$上吗？\n$B(7,9)$；\n$C(10,7)$；\n$D(0,-12)$；\n$E(-8,4\\sqrt{5})$。",
        "figures": []
      },
      {
        "number": "98",
